+| Layer | What | Commits |
+|---|---|---|
+| upstream `ggml-org/llama.cpp` master | 5d806aa25 (2026-09-08) | base |
+| [mxxm-t/mx-llama.cpp](https://github.com/mxxm-t/mx-llama.cpp) fork state (tag b10912, upstream base 0f3a71be1 (2026-09-02)) | gfx906 MMQ tile table (+33% prefill), custom peer-write XGMI allreduce and whole-token HIP graph, concurrent lane dispatch, multi-stage tensor parallelism, MTP optimisations, q8 repack, PLE-table sharding for Qwen3.8-Flash-Next — see `FEATURES.md` | 152 (merged with upstream master 2026-09-08; 104 upstream commits newer than the fork's base) |
+| Exabit gfx906 series | the measured patch series below | 10 |
